  {
   "text": "{\"explanations\":[{\"signal_id\":\"42704b00-fa4d-4713-836b-820efd535012\",\"explanation\":\"Revenue reached {{fact:e959bfd5-abb7-47e5-a334-99dfbb8654e2}} of plan against a covenant floor of {{fact:3755719f-7547-4045-a3fd-6739b19e4094}}, so headroom is negative at {{fact:1fe991a3-04a0-442a-b354-f9570c0a7fb5}}. The covenant measure therefore sits below its threshold, not merely close to it. This is the covenant view of the same shortfall flagged by the revenue-below-plan signal.\"},{\"signal_id\":\"f1448053-e626-49e7-9a32-a74c5df08534\",\"explanation\":\"Revenue came in at {{fact:a0ab2814-6e71-4861-8936-838587855357}} of plan, a material miss for a subscription business whose plan underpins its cash runway. It is the operating cause behind the revenue covenant falling below its floor. If the miss persists, it may also explain the steady erosion in cash headroom.\"},{\"signal_id\":\"cef2f5dc-b6bd-4659-8837-9193fe486c94\",\"explanation\":\"Unrestricted cash of {{fact:f6e501ae-5be2-4942-95b6-ecc0bf3ee257}} remains well above the {{fact:cf41bfe4-6836-4f51-aabf-2439f8c303cc}} minimum, but headroom has declined each month, from {{fact:b08244fb-64ac-46cf-989e-ab5bd9ef506f}} in August to {{fact:f08fbe81-7679-4c37-83bb-5be89804ee94}} in September and {{fact:808ba721-2a2c-424f-987c-32d347db04d9}} in October. Ongoing burn alongside the revenue shortfall would fit this pattern; liquidity is not yet tight.\"},{\"signal_id\":\"47a70237-31c8-40eb-bf1b-e8b273748a3b\",\"explanation\":\"Revenue covenant headroom has deteriorated each month, from {{fact:77903ce4-ac26-4ad9-8797-33d708ef5b43}} in August to {{fact:bd775118-40c4-46b5-873b-efe55abc61ae}} in September and {{fact:1fe991a3-04a0-442a-b354-f9570c0a7fb5}} in October. It turned negative in September and the gap widened in October, showing the shortfall is worsening rather than a one-month miss.\"}],\"ranking\":[\"42704b00-fa4d-4713-836b-820efd535012\",\"f1448053-e626-49e7-9a32-a74c5df08534\",\"cef2f5dc-b6bd-4659-8837-9193fe486c94\",\"47a70237-31c8-40eb-bf1b-e8b273748a3b\"]}",
